<h2 class="heading-size-2 heading-bar" id="recommended-gear">
<span data-markup-content-target="1">
<span class="iconmedium" data-color="c11" data-contiguous="true" data-env="mists" data-game="wow" data-kind="round" data-tree="mists">
<ins class="" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/medium/ability_druid_flourish.jpg");'></ins>
<del></del></span> Recommended Gear for Restoration Druids in Mists of Pandaria Classic</span></h2>
<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="what-is-the-bis-restoration-druid-gear">
<span class="iconmedium" data-color="c11" data-contiguous="true" data-env="mists" data-game="wow" data-kind="round" data-tree="mists">
<ins class="" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/medium/spell_mage_runeofpower.jpg");'></ins>
<del></del></span> What is the BiS Restoration Druid gear?</h3>With many different sources of gearing and loot scarcity in Mists of Pandaria Classic, targeting your absolute Best in Slot gear isn't entirely realistic; instead, we've created a Best in Slot list of ideal Restoration Druid drops found in Phase 3 from raids, dungeons, Reputation, and World Bosses to help you decide what to prioritize.<div class="pad exclude-units"></div>While raid drops are generally the most reliable way of getting high item level gear, you'll often supplement it with gear from other sources, so you should reference the <a data-contiguous="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/guide/classes/druid/restoration/healer-stat-priority-pve">Stat Priorities for Restoration Druids</a> to help determine your own BiS gear based on what is available to you.<ul class="exclude-units"></ul>
<br/>
<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="bis-gear">Overall Best in Slot Gear for Restoration Druids</h3>The overall best in slot list includes only Siege of Orgrimmar options since it is significantly higher level than any other loot source in the game.<div class="pad exclude-units"></div>Item level remains particularly powerful so expect to wear your highest level gear in most slots, with exceptions for tier pieces and sometimes trinkets. <br/>
<br/>
<b>Your trinket slots are somewhat flexible, and on stacked fights <a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=104611/thoks-acid-grooved-tooth">
<img alt="Thok's Acid-Grooved Tooth" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_orgrimmarraid_trinket_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Thok's Acid-Grooved Tooth</span></a> is an absurdly powerful choice.</b>
<br/>
