<del></del></span> Tier &amp; Set Bonuses for Restoration Druids in Mists of Pandaria Classic</span></h2>The set bonuses available in Phase 5 are a <b>moderate upgrade</b> for Restoration Druid. Our Throne of Thunder tier set is stronger, but item level on gear is so strong that we'll swap to our tier 16 set once we acquire pieces that are 20 or so levels higher. If you do not have the Throne of Thunder tier set, then aim to get this right away.<h3 class="heading-size-3 heading-bar" id="tier-16">
<span data-markup-content-target="1">Tier 16 - <a data-entity="item-set" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item-set=1198/vestments-of-the-shattered-vale">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Vestments of the Shattered Vale</span></a></span></h3>
